{"id":1195,"root":"قوع","bw":"qwE","tr":"q-w-ʿ","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\">See Supplement </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَاعٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>An even place;</em> (S, voce <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَقَدٌّ</span>;) <em>plain,</em> or <em>level, land,</em> (S, Msb,) <em>that produces nothing;</em> (IF, Msb;) <em>plain,</em> or <em>soft, land,</em> (<span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَرْضٌ سَهْلَةٌ</span>,) <em>low, and free from mountains.</em> (K.) See also <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رَوضَةٌ</span>. Respecting its pls., see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَارٌ</span>. </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":397,"entries":2,"shownEntries":2,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"qwE"}